      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay but the pain is kinda throbbing now and it hurts more when i walk or move. if it really was something serious like appendicitis wouldn't i be like.. dying or something? i feel like i can handle it if i just take some extra strength ibuprofen and some tylenol to dull the pain so i can sleep it off. do you think that combination would be safe to take just to get through the night?",
